# RPG borders & list chrome



**Canonical spec:** [`docs/design/UI_TOKENS.md`](../../docs/design/UI_TOKENS.md) § Borders & focus.



## Quick rules



- **Lists / boards:** `rounded-md bg-black/20` + compact `<li>` rows — **no** per-row bordered expandables.

- **Borders:** `border-[var(--candle-rule)]` (or `/25` seams) — **never** bare `border`, `border-border`, or shadcn `outline` buttons in game UI.

- **Commands:** `RPG_COMMAND_CHIP` / `.rpg-mini-btn` — not `Button variant="outline"`.

- **Expand rows:** arena pattern — toggle inline summary under the row, not `GamePanelExpandable` stacks.



Match `ArenaScreen` before inventing new fight/queue layouts.


